  "thesis": "The GN sign problem arises because perturbation controls both barrier height AND energy. In nuclear physics these are independent: Coulomb barrier (structural, Z) vs alpha kinetic energy (dynamical, Q-value). In PAC/SEC: barrier = perspectival JSD (PAC, structural), kinetic energy = noise amplitude (SEC, dynamical entropy flux). Higher SEC flux -> more fluctuations -> barrier crossed sooner -> shorter FPT. This is the GN sign fix.",
